{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56251","headline":"采桑子（途中作） · 花蘂夫人","name":"采桑子（途中作）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初离蜀道心将碎，离恨绵绵。\n春日如年，马上时时闻杜鹃。\n三千宫女皆花貌，妾最婵娟。\n此去朝天，只恐君王宠爱偏。\n（见《能改斋漫录》卷十六。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷八九九仅收此词之上半阙。\n一说後半片爲後人补作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"花蘂夫人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}